Author: Brian Vincent <brainn@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 4 12:56:05 2025 -0700

    tail: fix tailing /dev/zero
    
    This fixes a bug where tail would run forever when tailing
    /dev/zero.  This behavior matches GNU tail.

